	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Non habeo in tanto rerum silentio, fr[ater] <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, quod scribam, nisi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quod ex <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpia</placeName> nostris scribere quidam non desinunt, cavendum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>esse nobis a Caesare; sed ea de re literas e <placeName>Norico</placeName> missas ad quendam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>amicum meum, mea manu descriptas, per tabellionem senatorium nuper ad <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>te dedi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dicitur iam appropinquare <placeName ref="l471">Spyrae</placeName> et esse praemissos illo, qui <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>militem gregarium conscribant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">De pontifice novo nihildum audimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Certatim incumbunt <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> et <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName>, ut sponsam illam, quaecunque tandem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>futura est, deducant domum et scorto confusionis perfruantur molliter, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>neque alia magis caussa saevire in sanguinem Christi carbonarium illud <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>iudicium ferunt, quam ut ei potiundae meretricis occasio non auferatur; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mire enim ab ipsa reiiciuntur, quicunque Christum videntur amaturi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>de iis eventu ipso edocebimur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interim sancte te oro, id ipsum, quod Ger<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>manice subscribo, meo nomine apud dominum <persName ref="p1888">Lavaterum</persName> summa fide sum<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>moque silentio expedire velis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Wellend so wol thuͦn und meinem günstigen herren <persName ref="p1888">Lavatern</persName> ainzayge<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>n, das unser pott uff 20. december widerum haim khomen und son<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dern hochen dankh ab allen orten bracht, mit gar früntlichem erbieten; <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>und so er noch nützit alhar zuͦ embieten verorndt hat, das er recht <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>still stande.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Mein herren werdind in den feyrtagen aindtweders ain <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>haimlichs böttli oder aber ain brieflin verordnen, uss welchem er <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>allen handel verston wirt, und daruf meinen herren ingehaim, was in <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>für as best anseche, wol radten können etc.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Der guͤtig gott welle imm <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>und üch ain glücksälig, guͦt und haylsam angend jar verlychen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName>, celeriter, 23. decembris anno 1549°.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName>Antronius</persName> und mein herren sechend wol zuͦsammen; allain wil eß ettwas mangels ha<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ben dess staygerenß dess feld- und walch- gelts halber Darinn man sich aber gern wirt laßen wysen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Doctissimo pien<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tissimoque viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> episcopo, domino suo inprimis colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>